ISO/IEC 42001 STARTER KIT
Version {{version}}, as of {{datum}}

ISO/IEC 42001 Starter Kit by Andreas Gapsch, KMU-CIO, kmu-cio.ch

A kit for small and medium-sized enterprises that want to build an AI
management system (AIMS) under ISO/IEC 42001, with or without an existing
ISMS under ISO/IEC 27001. The goal is readiness for the stage 1 audit.


HOW TO START
------------
1. Extract the ZIP file completely (do not just open it in the preview).
2. Double-click START.html and open the AIMS Manager from there. It is the
   main route: guide, registers, processes, a library for your documents
   and, in the knowledge area, the guide book, frameworks and glossary.
   Edge or Chrome are recommended: only there does the library connect a
   folder of your choice (for example OneDrive or a network drive). In
   Firefox and Safari the library is kept in browser storage; back it up
   there regularly as a ZIP.
3. Choose your path: with an ISMS or without an ISMS (see below). The
   template folders remain for everyone who only works with Word and
   Excel; the guide book as a PDF is the print version.


